.SH NAME
frontend/node_modules/fast-equals Directory Reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "fast-equals"
.PP
  

.PP
Perform \fBblazing fast\fP equality comparisons (either deep or shallow) on two objects passed, while also maintaining a high degree of flexibility for various implementation use-cases\&. It has no dependencies, and is ~2kB when minified and gzipped\&.

.PP
The following types are handled out-of-the-box:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Plain objects (including \fRreact\fP elements and \fRArguments\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Arrays
.IP "\(bu" 2
Typed Arrays
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRDate\fP objects
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRRegExp\fP objects
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRMap\fP / \fRSet\fP iterables
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRPromise\fP objects
.IP "\(bu" 2
Primitive wrappers (\fRnew Boolean()\fP / \fRnew Number()\fP / \fRnew String()\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Custom class instances, including subclasses of native classes
.PP

.PP
Methods are available for deep, shallow, or referential equality comparison\&. In addition, you can opt into support for circular objects, or performing a "strict" comparison with unconventional property definition, or both\&. You can also customize any specific type comparison based on your application's use-cases\&.
