[Custom \fR@@toStringTag\fP support]('\&./recipes/special-objects\&.md)
.PP
.SH "Benchmarks"
.PP
All benchmarks were performed on an i9-11900H Ubuntu Linux 24\&.04 laptop with 64GB of memory using NodeJS version \fR20\&.17\&.0\fP, and are based on averages of running comparisons based deep equality on the following object types:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Primitives (\fRString\fP, \fRNumber\fP, \fRnull\fP, \fRundefined\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRFunction\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRObject\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRArray\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRDate\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRRegExp\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRreact\fP elements
.IP "\(bu" 2
A mixed object with a combination of all the above types
.PP

